1
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:06,669
Lesson 20. Bob gets an angry call from Carol.

2
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:13,929
Carol calls Bob to tell him that a customer found a hair in her cookie. Bob wants Carol

3
00:00:13,779 --> 00:00:20,969
to forget about this, but Carol thinks it's very serious. She refuses to buy any more

4
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:26,689
cookies from Bob. Bob, a lady came into the village market today,

5
00:00:26,539 --> 00:00:33,449
ranting and raving. Oh yeah, what happened? She found a blue hair in her chocolate chip cookie.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,729
Aha. I can see how she'd be taken aback. Does anybody in your family have blue hair?

7
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:50,570
As a matter of fact, my son's girlfriend Amber has blue hair. Bob, I can't sell your cookies anymore.

8
00:00:51,479 --> 00:00:56,670
Aren't you blowing things out of proportion? The health department would throw

9
00:00:56,520 --> 00:01:01,609
the book at me if they found out about this. Couldn't we just sweep this under the rug?

10
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:10,609
No, this is too serious. But I was just getting a handle on the cookie business. Now what would I do?

11
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:16,690
I don't have any other way of making a living. My heart goes out to you, Bob,

12
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:24,190
but you need to get your act together. I want to sell chocolate chip cookies, not hair cookies.

13
00:01:24,819 --> 00:01:28,330
I guess I just knocked myself out for the past week for nothing.

14
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:29,790
Clearly.

